{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_qiubai_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_qiubai_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"如冰碎雪融","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_qiubai_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"a85ed09651b54325e58aa1f312e5049d8bdf7409c85679e581d39fe8f149ce5c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomA"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"情況已經清楚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，小姐，先前我們當你是持劍入室搶劫，原來是誤會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為了逃命闖進別人家屋子，我們能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至於攻擊你的那些人，目擊者給的線索不多，但近衛局會盡力查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，打破的玻璃還是要賠……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我賠不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心，我其實是來通知你，你的親人替你解釋過了，賠償金也補上了，你可以離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……親人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我猜你初來龍門投靠親戚，難免有點不自在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但這種情況，你拜託她幫幫忙，總好過留下案底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你劍又快，又不肯解釋情況，要是我們逮捕你的時候你真的出劍抵抗，麻煩可就大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"習武強身健體，是件好事，但以後在龍門，還是要多加注意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請，小姐。武器我們還你，回家去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我不知道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……沒什麼，多謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……老闆，是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿著，治跌打損傷的藥膏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，只是些碎玻璃劃的小傷口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝你救我出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可真是嚇人欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸虧我看你兩天沒從店門前路過，向鄰裡打聽了幾句，才知道你被人追殺，一路逃進了上城區的氣派公寓樓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人注意到我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對門大牌檔的服務生，熱心，嘴碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽她說過什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽她說過，租賃店是兇宅，許多年前死過人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還聽說你偶爾神神秘秘地去墓地，不知道掃的是誰的墓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，她再看那些奇幻故事雜誌，恐怕就要產生被害妄想了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但她有一點說得不錯，老闆，你是個怪人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我惹了事，你不害怕，反而來救我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……仇姑娘，你才是那個怪人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我沒去近衛局替你解釋，你自己是不是就開不了這個口？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有可信的身分，也不知道追我的是哪個仇家，很難解釋得清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如拖延時間，找一個逃脫的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你逃得出？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山賊城寨，商賈押運隊，逃過幾次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那還是不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，你不是要去玉門找人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門很快就要跟玉門交接了，你要是錯過了，之後兩座城可就隔得越來越遠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"移動城市日行數十里，像你之前那樣徒步趕路，不知道又要走幾個月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早幾個月晚幾個月，都沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且眼下玉門正預備戰事，不迎接遊客，我沒有合適的名目，本來也進不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“預備戰事”……天有不測風雲，更何況戰事當前呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有想見的人，這種時候還不著急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……除非你不害怕那人會死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，你把我救了出來，我該怎麼謝你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個每天在房樑上抱著劍過夜的小姑娘，我還能向她要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我畢竟有一把劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有空還來店裡玩就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你躲在這裡安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，你不是說自己生在江上水寨嗎？在龍門，高架交流道也算是橋，這交流道下的小街也能算是半個住處吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那台老電視機也剛好配老片子的光碟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要別看得太入迷，把自己也當成電視裡的大俠就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"裡屋放的都是二三十年的舊東西，你隨便一比劃，說不好就全碰壞了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視機裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“……此去山高水遠，江湖一別，恐怕再難相見。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視機裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“不見倒也是好事。江湖裡會追著你來的，永遠只有仇人，我可不願意與各位反目成仇……”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"仇白對螢幕上的故事並沒有什麼興趣，只是不斷地按下快轉鍵。\n那天她意外看到了一張海報，所以才走進了這家影碟租賃店。\n但她翻遍了積灰的光碟片，也沒有從其他影片裡找到那個所謂的“宗師”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這裡面的“大俠”，倒是都和那電視劇裡的他一樣手不沾血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照這裡面的演繹，血濺出來的時候，懂得武功的人已經運起輕功退開了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“做得好，丫頭，這是唬人的動作，力容易收住。”\n“這個嘛……是削麵的動作。刀揮下去，就別想回頭了。”\n“哎，你可千萬別讓你爹娘知道我們教你這些。”\n“不是覺得你太小了舞不動刀槍。他們……應該還是希望你回得了頭吧。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪能那麼乾淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"仇姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"該不是在裡屋睡著了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，我醒著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，醒著就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫我看一下店，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你信任我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上次那事不是已經過去大半個月了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，深夜來的人不多，這店招牌也不打眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道追在你背後的是什麼人，但以我在這裡生活二十多年的經驗，流氓惡棍一般不會找過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的有呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就把捲簾門放下來，關門歇業，不用等我回來。鑰匙找個機會塞到門口地毯底下就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，半夜倒是會有醉酒鬧事的小混蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是人家進了店，不方便趕走，你就照他們要求給點東西息事寧人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種事難免會發生，你如果遇上了，就別太在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的遇到這種無賴，我會給他們一點教訓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，可別把小事鬧成大麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會，我知道怎麼嚇唬他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對我有恩，我也只能以此盡力報答了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就麻煩你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你捧的花很好看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，是嗎？我也很喜歡素白的花，可惜，不是什麼好寓意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是要去掃墓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，算是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生死有命，談不上好與不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒什麼，你去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"租賃影碟的價目表在牆上，麻煩自己看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"店主，連句“歡迎光臨”都沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"借酒鬧事的，我已經送出去一個——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你認識這把小刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上個月我看過一把一模一樣的，插在我角落的牆上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說你當時反應很快，立刻從窗戶撞進了路邊大樓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該像之前一樣躲在暗處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"之前那把可不是我的刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"在你拔劍之前，不如先猜猜有幾個人正盯著這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……刀柄上有標識。你們是那支商隊的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"準確地說，我們“黃沙幫”收錢做事，護鏢只是其中之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是搶了你們一袋乾糧，你們就要這樣追殺我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"看在你是個流浪荒野的餓死鬼的分上，你要是當時自己吃了，我們也不會說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"但你打傷了我的同僚，又拿那袋乾糧救了我們丟下的一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是習慣了分人一口吃食。過去幾年，許多人這麼救過我，我總不能見死不救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"那個被丟下的傢伙本來就是個禍害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"他活下來之後更是一心報復，害得我們斷了一條財路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，只殺他一個，怎麼能解氣，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不好意思，打擾了，我等一下再……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我不該出劍……引起誤會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們快打烊了，今天的椒鹽鱗獸還沒賣完，老闆要我端來請你們吃一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛從油裡撈上來，這時候還是熱的，冷了就不好吃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們不方便伸手接的話，我就放在櫃檯上了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祝二位吃得好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"……出乎意料啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是找到了個安穩的落腳處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是偶然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些東西，就像裝在玻璃罩子裡……我畢竟拿著劍，一不小心就會全部撞碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"就像現在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。我倒是突然有了個想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你欠的是實實在在的金錢債，不用命還倒也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你眼裡確實只有錢財。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你弄錯了，我們本來做的也是維護秩序、懲惡揚善之事，只不過是有償行善罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你這麼喜歡多管閒事，不如管得再多一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你看這本帳簿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"光是在龍門，就有好幾位江洋大盜和連環殺手正在被懸賞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你替我們做事，拿賞金抵債，城市中的惡棍少一個，你也更方便過你的安寧日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"反之……你如果不想配合，這條街恐怕就很難保住現下的安寧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛說，“帳簿”上的這些人，不是大盜，便是殺手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是聽我媽講的！李老闆去掃墓，那墓上……立的是一塊空白石碑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也不是每年固定的日子去，這家店開了二十多年，她好像總共也沒去過幾次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她心裡一定藏著什麼事，重到她都沒辦法把那個人的名字寫出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道……那個人……也許是那些人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我本來就不打算留在這條街。我要去的是玉門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們應該能幫我從物資運輸隊那裡找一條路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果以此作為交換條件，我或許可以替你們做事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"不把麻煩留在這裡……哼，小姐，你是個聰明人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……希望如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，今天來得這麼早？我才剛開門呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊，每次都說自己對這些光碟沒多大興趣，實際上是越來越沉迷了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……確實沒看進去多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爛片多，看不進去也正常。你還記得什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只記得大部分的武功都是花架子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，那你還真是什麼都沒看進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但擺在外面的這些都挑得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我現在年紀大了，骨頭都縮成一團了，也只有眼睛還明亮一點，看得出誰是真功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"換作一般人，在我惹事被近衛局拘留的時候就該感到害怕了，絕不會冒險說謊來救我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟他們周旋，我還是有不少經驗的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖說都是些年輕時候犯錯累積的經驗，但如果現在能用這些耍滑頭的本領來拉住另一個人，倒也不壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰教你用的劍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親的……朋友教了一些，自己這一路學了一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道用得怎麼樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，不知道為好。我寧可你這把劍沒見過血，別……像我一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能幫我扶一下梯子嗎？最上面的光碟也該換一批新的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天到下午才有人來租光碟，一般來說，沒接近二十四小時，那幾個老主顧是不會來還的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"仇白低頭看了一眼隨身的照片，上面是一個年輕些的、頭髮還沒有全白的黎博利女性。\n懸賞中寫明，此人是慣於殺人越貨的劫匪，同伙大都已經伏法，只有她一人多年來始終在逃。\n老闆並沒有回頭看她，只是專注地打理著店鋪。\n小街上，各家商家的捲窗門正嘩啦啦地升起，熟悉的鄰里互相打著招呼。\n收銀台上的茶盞冒著熱氣，電視裡播著一部百來集的家庭情境喜劇。\n光碟裡沒有她的仇人，但難免有她這五年裡、數千里路上的某些時刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你那天去祭奠的是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好奇的話，或許下次可以陪我一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"narration","text":"仇白握緊劍柄的手漸漸鬆開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從小，爹教我有仇報仇，娘教我有恩報恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，突然說這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要上路了，來跟你道聲謝。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她將那張帶有懸賞的照片塞進收銀台抽屜的夾縫，然後快步走了出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"後會有期。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我是不是好幾天沒見到你了？要不要吃點……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"租賃店關門了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼時候的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？呃，傍晚剛關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還跟李老闆打了個招呼，她說今天有點事，提前打烊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她應該是走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，是啊，我看著她走的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，要不要進來坐一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不了，我只是路過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後多半也不會再露面了，會有危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大牌檔服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"危險？什麼危險……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，讓我自己過去看看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鑰匙留在了這裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不該這樣……她怎麼能這樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cenmetery"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"李老闆……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜到你可能會來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想把店鋪留給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意思是，恩怨會在你身上一筆勾銷，所以往後我繼續生活在這裡，也不會再被人打擾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是不喜歡，只管交給別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的仇家什麼時候來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你或許是上了年紀，也放下了武器，但，我手上還有一把劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先收起劍，陪我坐一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝你的好心，又是留下懸賞令提醒，又是要護我脫身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可恨我的人有那麼多，他們現在才追上我，已經足夠我放聲嘲笑了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你主動找上他們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否則，偌大的龍門，他們無從搜捕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是我走到這裡，才害得這條小街被人注意到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二三十年的舊東西，本來就是一碰就碎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真要說起來，撞碎它的人也不是你。我不幫你，也會幫另一個落難的劍客，彷徨的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我這樣背著血債的人，死了不也很好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那天就想激我對你動手，或是揭發你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒去四處打聽，我恐怕就會對你的惡名信以為真，而不會來見你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那匪幫雖然作惡多端，但你不算頭目，不該被追緝這麼多年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再加上匪幫的人死得七七八八，你卻安然無恙地活了下來……我想到你或許是叛徒，但更有可能是臥底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你確實問到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒人能給定論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能來問你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要問你……就算從此沒人知道你行的是正義之事，你在九泉之下也無法開口解釋，你也不在乎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼可在乎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我既不是給朝廷做臥底，也不曾把劫匪的贓物拋撒給貧民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們那一幫跑江湖的，最多只是比匪徒稍微善良一點。血雨裡來去，到底也不是為大義，只是為了恩怨情仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才想攔住你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"入了江湖，就再也脫不了身了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，龍門遭過雪災嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是不時下雪。怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……只是不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從小，爹教我有仇報仇，娘教我有恩報恩，這些都好懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但，爹也教我江水寬闊，能去許多地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我走了這麼久，現在回頭想想，反而發現……大地上遠不止這麼一條江，它有許多流不到的地方……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"譬如龍門這樣能夠躲避天災的移動城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……而我出生那年，一場天災卻能讓已經完成春種的姜齊重回嚴冬，整個五月都在下雪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天地偌大，我不明白，困住我們的，究竟是什麼？人們常說離不開的江湖，又該是什麼江，什麼湖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呵呵，好問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不走到玉門，我恐怕是想不明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須見到那個人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能想辦法，我們一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必再想啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仇家已經來過了，我自己喝了毒酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時辰也快到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……老闆，這是什麼人的墓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你如果還有遺憾，我……會幫你去完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，不必了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……我自己的墓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你早就準備好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送走的，送不走的，或遲或早都會找上門來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遺憾皆是生者的遺憾，死不過如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人逐漸渙散的眼瞳盯著她看了許久，最後慢慢地轉向墓碑的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"租賃店老闆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊……那江水……又會流往什麼地方呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人已經沒有呼吸了。\n仇白將她的軀體扶正，倚在石碑旁，又替她合上眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她最後回頭看的這塊墓碑，到現在還沒有刻上名字……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身後事……你究竟在乎嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是匪徒，或是大俠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……又或者，只是了卻一切江湖恩怨的，租賃店的李老闆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死在二十多年前落腳龍門之日，或是今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不在乎……還是被這個問題困住了一生呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"龍門的公墓裡，這塊空石碑格格不入，彷彿等待著回答。\n仇白抽出長劍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"武器庫裡堆了那麼多廢鐵劍，你偷偷拿一把出來玩，不會被發現的。你拿好劍，我教你怎麼用。\n你看，這樣是劈，這樣是挑……哎哎哎哎小心！\n欸，你沒事吧？嚇死我了，萬一你有個三長兩短，我這腦袋肯定也……\n總之，這劍對你一個小孩來說還是太重了，先放下。可千萬不能再讓劍甩脫手了！\n……你笑什麼？\n我打落了好多花！真好看！\n要是能讓爹看到就好了……\n白色的，不僅是雪啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cenmetery"},{"type":"narration","text":"劍氣斬出。\n被劍尖挑起的卻只有一朵白花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，恩怨難斷，所以人們逃不過，走不出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這不是能讓我放下劍的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……也不是我依然拿著這把劍的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，我去過玉門了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，我想我也有自己的答案了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"白花自劍刃落到墓碑前，仇白轉身離去。\n那塊碑石上，仍然空無一字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
